 "press_quotes": [
  {
   "quote": "Living spaces have also been the subject of constant reflection to obtain a livable surface area of 90 m2 on the interior and 87 m2 on the exterior. This step is materialized also in the flow of movement on board, with, for example, sliding glass doors, to ensure continuity between the cockpit and saloon, and passage behind the aft bench seating.",
   "source": "YACHT CLASS"
  },
  {
   "quote": "Aboard the Lagoon SIXTY 5, you can enjoy an incredible 360° view of the horizon.  Straight ahead or toward the aft, your gaze is always drawn to the ocean.",
   "source": "VOILES ET VOILIERS"
  },
  {
   "quote": "In our test sails, the SIXTY 5 impressed us with its performance and comfort.  The builder offers a wide array of semi-custom fit and finishes.",
   "source": "MULTICOQUES MAGAZINE"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The aft lines of the coachroof and the sculpted bow design immediately attest to the family resemblance between the SEVENTY 7 and the SIXTY 5. While the freeboard remains impressive, Patrick le Quément, responsible for the exterior design, sought to refine the silhouette of this new model as much as possible.",
   "source": "LE FIGARO NAUTISME"
  }
 ]
